# Normalise all text files to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# Without this, a collaborator with core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default)
# gets LF -> CRLF conversion on checkout, which silently mutates generated
# and vendored files. This is not hypothetical: during the initial GitHub
# reconnection, a rebase rewrote the data/_raw source snapshots from LF to
# CRLF, growing abinrimal/local_levels.json from 173,898 to 180,676 bytes
# and invalidating a SHA-256 provenance manifest that had just been written.
* text=auto eol=lf
